00:08:42.125 --> 00:08:44.194
MEN.

00:08:42.392 --> 00:08:45.462
THEN DON JR. IS ON RECORD SAYING

00:08:44.327 --> 00:08:47.998
HE'S MORE AFRAID FOR HIS SONS

00:08:45.595 --> 00:08:48.798
THEN HE IS FOR HIS DAUGHTERS.

00:08:48.131 --> 00:08:50.901
WOW.

00:08:48.932 --> 00:08:53.270
IN OTHER WORDS, PROFESSOR FORD,

00:08:51.034 --> 00:08:57.007
WHO STEPS FORWARD, PUTS HER NAME

00:08:53.403 --> 00:08:57.974
OUT THERE, COMES FORWARD AND

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:58.441
TESTIFIES BEFORE CONGRESS,

00:08:58.108 --> 00:09:00.577
PROFESSOR FORD.

00:08:58.575 --> 00:09:01.411
YOUR TRAUMA, YOUR DIFFICULTY,

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:03.380
YOUR LIFETIME OF TRAUMA --

00:09:01.545 --> 00:09:04.047
STROKE WHAT WE ARE REALLY

00:09:03.513 --> 00:09:07.084
WORRIED ABOUT HIS BOYS.

00:09:04.181 --> 00:09:08.986
HOW RIDICULOUS?

00:09:07.217 --> 00:09:10.921
&gt;&gt; Greg: JUAN, YOU HAVE SONS.

00:09:09.119 --> 00:09:11.822
WOULDN'T YOU WANT THEM TO HAVE

00:09:11.054 --> 00:09:13.824
DUE PROCESS.

00:09:11.955 --> 00:09:14.358
&gt;&gt; Juan: HE WAS NOT CHARGED

00:09:13.957 --> 00:09:15.826
WITH THE CRIME.

00:09:14.491 --> 00:09:16.526
&gt;&gt; Greg: COURT OF PUBLIC

00:09:15.959 --> 00:09:17.828
OPINION MAY BE WORSE.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:20.063
&gt;&gt; Juan: HERE'S THE THING.

00:09:17.961 --> 00:09:21.898
IF YOU PUT SOMEONE ON.

00:09:20.197 --> 00:09:34.077
YOU SAY DID HE LIE?

00:09:22.032 --> 00:09:34.778
HE SAYS --

00:09:34.211 --> 00:09:35.512
SPECIFICALLY HE SAID HE HAD NO

00:09:34.911 --> 00:09:36.213
KNOWLEDGE ABOUT THIS NEW YORKER

00:09:35.646 --> 00:09:36.613
ARTICLE AND THEN IT TURNS OUT

00:09:36.346 --> 00:09:37.314
GUESS WHAT.

00:09:36.747 --> 00:09:37.648
HE IS TRYING TO GET PEOPLE TO

00:09:37.447 --> 00:09:38.582
REFUTE.

00:09:37.781 --> 00:09:39.850
&gt;&gt; Dana: NO, THAT'S NOT TRUE.

00:09:38.715 --> 00:09:40.784
&gt;&gt; Tucker: MANY SAY THIS IS

00:09:39.983 --> 00:09:42.252
NOT A LEGAL PROCEEDING.

00:09:40.918 --> 00:09:43.687
IT'S A JOB INTERVIEW.

00:09:42.386 --> 00:09:45.022
DUE PROCESS DOESN'T APPLY.

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.422
THE RULES OF BASIC FAIRNESS

00:09:45.155 --> 00:09:48.392
DON'T APPLY.

00:09:45.556 --> 00:09:49.793
IS THAT THE STANDARD YOU WANT?

00:09:48.525 --> 00:09:52.262
HOLD ON.

00:09:50.727 --> 00:09:52.963
FOR DUE PROCESS, IT'S A LEGAL

00:09:52.396 --> 00:09:54.598
TERM FOR FAIRNESS.

00:09:53.096 --> 00:09:56.066
IF I ACCUSE YOU OF SOMETHING, I

00:09:54.731 --> 00:09:56.967
HAVE TO SHOW YOU DID IT.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.802
THAT DOESN'T JUST APPLY TO

00:09:57.100 --> 00:10:00.571
COURT.

00:09:58.936 --> 00:10:01.705
IT APPLIES TO HOW YOU RAISE YOUR

00:10:00.704 --> 00:10:03.207
KID AND HOW YOU DEAL WITH YOUR

00:10:01.839 --> 00:10:04.274
WIFE AND YOUR COWORKERS.

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:06.176
ARE YOU COMFORTABLE WITH THAT

00:10:04.408 --> 00:10:07.110
STATEMENT?

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:10.981
&gt;&gt; Juan: IT'S SUSPENDING THE

00:10:07.244 --> 00:10:11.982
IDEA THAT SOMEHOW YOU HAVE THE

00:10:11.114 --> 00:10:13.584
RULES OF A CRIMINAL PROCEEDING.

00:10:12.115 --> 00:10:14.485
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S A VERY SIMPLE

00:10:13.717 --> 00:10:15.686
RULE.

00:10:14.618 --> 00:10:18.088
HOLD ON.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.156
A SENATOR SAYS YOU ARE ACCUSED.

00:10:18.222 --> 00:10:20.557
PROVE YOU ARE INNOCENT.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:22.426
&gt;&gt; Juan: NO, IT'S NOT.

00:10:20.691 --> 00:10:23.160
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THEY SAID THAT OUT

00:10:22.559 --> 00:10:24.795
LOUD.

00:10:23.294 --> 00:10:27.765
ARE YOU COMFORTABLE WITH THAT?

00:10:24.928 --> 00:10:28.165
&gt;&gt; Juan: YOU ARE DISTORTING

00:10:27.898 --> 00:10:30.167
THAT.

00:10:28.299 --> 00:10:31.568
YOU ARE NOT AS ATTRACTIVE AS

00:10:30.301 --> 00:10:32.169
MOST PEOPLE WHO SIT IN THAT

00:10:31.702 --> 00:10:32.870
YEAR.

00:10:32.303 --> 00:10:36.240
&gt;&gt; Greg: I FIND THAT TO BE A

00:10:33.003 --> 00:10:40.344
BIT SEXIST.

00:10:36.373 --> 00:10:40.744
DANA NEEDS TO CLARIFY.

00:10:40.477 --> 00:10:42.646
LET DANA.

00:10:40.878 --> 00:10:43.314
DANA NEEDS TO CLARIFY.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:47.084
&gt;&gt; Dana: THERE IS SOMETHING

00:10:43.447 --> 00:10:47.818
THAT'S UNFAIR ABOUT THIS

00:10:47.217 --> 00:10:50.354
SUGGESTION THAT BRETT KAVANAUGH

00:10:47.952 --> 00:10:51.589
WAS TRYING TO COACH PEOPLE

00:10:50.487 --> 00:10:54.759
THROUGH TEXT MESSAGES THAT THEY

00:10:51.722 --> 00:10:55.159
WOULD CORROBORATE A STORY IN THE

00:10:54.892 --> 00:10:55.960
NEW YORKER.

00:10:55.292 --> 00:10:57.695
IT'S NOT THE CASE.

00:10:56.093 --> 00:11:00.998
THAT'S NOT WHAT HAPPENED.

00:10:57.828 --> 00:11:01.799
HAVING BEEN THE SPOKESPERSON FOR

00:11:01.132 --> 00:11:03.267
ROBERTS AND ALITO.

00:11:01.932 --> 00:11:04.769
FOR EXAMPLE, YOU HAVE SO MANY

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.970
PRESS QUESTIONS ABOUT THINGS

00:11:04.902 --> 00:11:06.670
THAT MIGHT'VE HAPPENED,

00:11:06.103 --> 00:11:09.840
JOHN ROBERTS, THE BIG SCANDAL

00:11:06.804 --> 00:11:10.374
WAS THAT HE WAS A MEMBER OF THE

00:11:09.974 --> 00:11:11.409
FEDERALIST SOCIETY.

00:11:10.508 --> 00:11:12.610
WHAT DO I HAVE TO DO?

00:11:11.542 --> 00:11:14.412
I'VE GOT A CALL, WAS

00:11:12.743 --> 00:11:14.946
JOHN ROBERTS A MEMBER OF THE

00:11:14.545 --> 00:11:16.847
FEDERALIST SOCIETY?

00:11:15.079 --> 00:11:17.615
WHAT HAPPENED, DO THEY GIVE A

00:11:16.981 --> 00:11:19.216
SPEECH?

00:11:17.748 --> 00:11:20.418
YES, I HAVE TO ASK ABOUT IT.

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:22.286
IT'S NOT BECAUSE YOU'RE TRYING

00:11:20.551 --> 00:11:22.820
TO SQUASH THE STORY AND THAT'S

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:23.888
UNFAIR.

00:11:22.954 --> 00:11:24.956
&gt;&gt; Juan: NO IT'S NOT.

00:11:24.021 --> 00:11:25.623
&gt;&gt; Dana: YES, IT IS.

00:11:25.089 --> 00:11:27.191
&gt;&gt; Juan: I THOUGHT YOU WERE

00:11:25.756 --> 00:11:28.626
GOING TO SAY IT'S POSSIBLE THAT

00:11:27.325 --> 00:11:29.794
THE REPORTER FROM THE NEW YORKER

00:11:28.759 --> 00:11:31.629
WAS IN TOUCH WITH HIS ADVISORS

00:11:29.927 --> 00:11:33.798
AND MAY BE HIM THEN HE REACHED

00:11:31.762 --> 00:11:35.399
OUT TO PEOPLE.

00:11:33.931 --> 00:11:38.169
REMEMBER, DANA, HE TESTIFIED

00:11:35.533 --> 00:11:39.136
THAT HE KNEW NOTHING ABOUT THIS

00:11:38.302 --> 00:11:40.338
UNTIL THE NEW YORKER.

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:41.639
&gt;&gt; Jesse: HE TESTIFIED HE

00:11:40.471 --> 00:11:42.440
DIDN'T KNOW WHAT THE SPECIFIC

00:11:41.772 --> 00:11:44.375
ALLEGATION WAS.

00:11:42.573 --> 00:11:45.142
HE HAD GOTTEN WIND THAT THIS

00:11:44.509 --> 00:11:46.878
WOMAN WAS CALLING AROUND.

00:11:45.276 --> 00:11:47.211
YOU KNOW WHY SHE WAS CALLING

00:11:47.011 --> 00:11:48.880
AROUND?

00:11:47.345 --> 00:11:49.247
SHE DIDN'T KNOW IT WAS

00:11:49.013 --> 00:11:51.349
KAVANAUGH.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:52.383
SHE WAS SAYING TO HER FRIENDS,

00:11:51.482 --> 00:11:53.184
WASN'T KAVANAUGH?

00:11:52.517 --> 00:11:54.852
NOT SURE.

00:11:53.317 --> 00:11:55.553
HE'D GOTTEN WIND SOMETHING WAS

00:11:54.986 --> 00:11:57.088
COMING DOWN THE PIPELINE SO HE

00:11:55.687 --> 00:11:57.655
SAID TO SOME OF HIS BUDDIES, I

00:11:57.221 --> 00:12:00.091
DIDN'T DO ANYTHING.

00:11:57.789 --> 00:12:01.392
LET'S MAKE SURE I DIDN'T DO

00:12:00.224 --> 00:12:02.360
ANYTHING.

00:12:01.526 --> 00:12:03.761
[ALL SPEAKING]

00:12:02.493 --> 00:12:06.297
&gt;&gt; Greg: WE'VE GOT TO GO.

00:12:03.895 --> 00:12:10.234
I LIKE THE FACT THAT JESSE IS

00:12:06.431 --> 00:12:11.035
DOING THE OLD SYMBOL FOR A

00:12:10.368 --> 00:12:12.470
TELEPHONE.

00:12:11.169 --> 00:12:14.739
[LAUGHTER]

00:12:12.603 --> 00:12:16.140
&gt;&gt; Juan: ONE LAST THING.

00:12:14.872 --> 00:12:18.309
TOO MUCH FOR YOU, GREG.

00:12:16.274 --> 00:12:19.744
YOU DON'T WANT TO HEAR THE OTHER

00:12:18.443 --> 00:12:20.778
SIDE.

